# MV pfsense
En Interfaces -> Assignments
Selecciona la red global (WAM):
	* Configuraciones por defecto
Selecciona la primera red privada:
	* Type: static IPv4
	* LAN address: 192.168.10.1
	* Mascara: /24 (255.255.255.0)
	* IPv4 Upstream Gateway: None
	* DHCPv4: enable
Activar la red segunda red privada, desde un navegador en una mv temporal:
	* sudo ifconfig eth0 192.168.10.10 netmask 255.255.255.0
	* Habilitar el uso de OPT1.
Selecciona la segunda red privada:
        * Type: static IPv4
        * LAN address: 192.168.20.1
        * Mascara: /24 (255.255.255.0)
        * IPv4 Upstream Gateway: None
        * DHCPv4: enable

# MV ubuntu (devices IoT)

## Instalacion docker engine
sudo apt update
sudo apt install ca-certificates curl
sudo install -m 0755 -d /etc/apt/keyrings
sudo curl -fsSL https://download.docker.com/linux/debian/gpg -o /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc
sudo chmod a+r /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc
sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/docker.sources <<EOF
Types: deb
URIs: https://download.docker.com/linux/debian
Suites: $(. /etc/os-release && echo "$VERSION_CODENAME")
Components: stable
Architectures: $(dpkg --print-architecture)
Signed-By: /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc
EOF

sudo apt update
sudo apt install -y docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io docker-buildx-plugin docker-compose-plugin
sudo systemctl enable --now docker
sudo docker run --rm hello-world
sudo ifconfig eth0 192.168.10.10 netmask 255.255.255.0

## Configuracion inicial  antes de iniciar - docker compose
cd ~/architecture
sudo docker compose config -q 
sudo docker compose build iot
sudo docker compose pull mosquitto captura
sudo docker compose up -d --scale iot=30
### comprobacion de funcionamiento
sudo docker compose ps
sudo docker compose ps --status running --services
sudo docker compose ps --status running --format json \
  | python3 -c '
import json
import sys

containers = [json.loads(line) for line in sys.stdin if line.strip()]
devices = [
    c for c in containers
    if c.get("Service") == "iot"
]

print(f"Dispositivos IoT en ejecución: {len(devices)}")
'
